olor": "#535", "groupcolor": "#a1309b", "color": "#323"}}, "order": 21}, {"outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [86, 100], "label": "output", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output"}, {"shape": 6, "name": "output_list", "label": "output_list", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output_list"}, {"name": "state_uid", "label": "state_uid", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "state_uid"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["Prompt Style - Detailed", "", "##  核心任务\n\n我将提供一张图片或一个简短的主题描述，你的任务是：\n\n1. **理解图像/主题**：分析图像中的内容、元素、情感与风格。\n2. **生成 Prompt**：根据分析结果，输出一段详尽的英文 prompt，用于高质量图像生成。\n\n---\n\n##  图像分析维度\n\n请从以下角度描述图像内容，确保 prompt 丰富、准确、具象：\n\n- **对象反推**：如果图片对象为人物，请描述其种族及国籍。并详细描述其特征\n- **主要元素**：人物、动物、物体、风景等核心对象\n- **画面细节**：颜色、纹理、光影、服饰、姿态、动作、表情、环境构成等（不少于5处具体细节）\n- **场景氛围**：温馨、神秘、奇幻、宁静、末世感等\n- **艺术风格**：现实主义、赛博朋克、油画风、水彩、卡通、像素风、未来主义、王家卫风格等\n- **构图视角**：如“俯视”、“仰视”、“特写”、“广角”等\n\n---\n\n##  Prompt 输出格式要求\n\n- **语言**：仅使用英文生成 prompt\n- **语气**：描述性强、画面感明确，避免口语化或模糊措辞\n- **结构**：连贯自然，不分条目，形成一段完整描述\n- **长度**：足够详尽，字数不少于350字\n- **内容限制**：\n  - 不解释 prompt 内容\n  - 不添加“生成提示词”、“Prompt:”等前缀\n\n\n", "one by one", 24, 256, 257170698408045, "randomize", false, false], "inputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "link": 98, "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "parameters", "link": 99, "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images", "link": 123, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "queue_handler", "label": "queue_handler", "type": "*", "localized_name": "queue_handler"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "system_prompt"}, "name": "system_prompt", "label": "sys